8DQQ7kNvwFrLjMx&_nc_oc=Adoz08hshIKqTYeZ45UdmOILdUTzsryr0gDmmY0Dmr_x3dv11vxNAHuK4AI6fBkDhxo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ7Oo1QOpTwAhKFhOlD0owS_xNTzHr4P0q6oVBXArM5UQ&oe=6B0DC4D7"}, "display_name": "Lettuce Sprint XR", "keywords": ["lettuces", "MixedReality", "Games", "simulation", "arcade"], "long_description": "Lettuce Sprint is the first immersive mixed-reality  agricultural simulation in the world, developed by Digi Fuzz Verse in the Food Valley (Wageningen, Netherlands). Designed for intuitive spatial play, it lets you cultivate real lettuce Varieties right inside your physical space using natural hand and controller interactions. Plant your seeds, fine-tune temperature, humidity, soil moisture, and light intensity, and watch your lettuces respond in real time through dynamic digital twins.\n\nEach round teaches the core environmental principles behind precision horticulture, turning complex biological and climate dynamics into hands\u2011on spatial learning. Lettuce Sprint offers a vibrant, tactile, science\u2011driven experience that blends agricultural education with playful discovery, perfect for anyone curious about sustainable farming, climate control, or cutting\u2011edge mixed\u2011reality design.", "short_description": "Lettuce Sprint is the first immersive mixed-reality  agricultural simulation in the world, developed by Digi Fuzz Verse in the Food Valley (Wageningen, Netherlands). Designed for intuitive spatial play, it lets you cultivate real lettuce Varieties right inside your physical space using natural hand and controller interactions. Plant your seeds, fine-tune temperature, humidity, soil moisture, and light intensity, and watch your lettuces respond in real time through dynamic digital twins."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/DigiFuzzVerse/lettuce-spint-xr/blob/main/Privacy%20Policy.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://github.com/DigiFuzzVerse/lettuc